CianwoodCity_Text_Woman3_1::
	.string "You crossed the sea to get here?\n"
	.string "That must have been hard.\p"
	.string "It would be much easier if your\n"
	.string "POKéMON knew how to FLY...\p"
	.string "But you can’t use FLY without this\n"
	.string "city’s GYM BADGE.\p"
	.string "If you beat the GYM LEADER here,\n"
	.string "come see me.\p"
	.string "I’ll have a nice gift for you.$"

CianwoodCity_Text_Woman3_2::
	.string "My husband lost to you, so he needs\n"
	.string "to train harder.\p"
	.string "That’s good, since he was getting a\n"
	.string "little chubby.$"

CianwoodCity_Text_Woman3_3::
	.string "You crossed the sea to get here?\n"
	.string "That must have been hard.\p"
	.string "It would be much easier if your\n"
	.string "POKéMON knew how to FLY...\p"
	.string "That’s CIANWOOD’s GYM BADGE!\p"
	.string "Then you should take this HM.$"

CianwoodCity_Text_Woman3_4::
	.string "Teach FLY to your POKéMON.\p"
	.string "You will be able to FLY instantly\n"
	.string "to anywhere you have visited.$"

CianwoodCity_Text_Woman2::
	.string "CHUCK, the GYM LEADER, spars with\n"
	.string "his fighting POKéMON.$"

CianwoodCity_Text_Youngster::
	.string "If you use FLY, you can get back\n"
	.string "to OLIVINE instantly.$"

CianwoodCity_Text_FatMan::
	.string "Boulders to the north of town can\n"
	.string "be crushed.\p"
	.string "They may be hiding something.\p"
	.string "Your POKéMON could use ROCK SMASH\n"
	.string "to break them.$"

CianwoodCity_Text_PkmnTrainer205_1::
	.string "You are a TRAINER, right?\p"
	.string "You know what, CIANWOOD CITY’s GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER is not accepting battles...\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "What do you say?\p"
	.string "A GYM LEADER has the responsability\n"
	.string "to accept any battle?\p"
	.string "But... But you are just a rookie\n"
	.string "trainer, I can tell!\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "I’ll prove it to you!$"

CianwoodCity_Text_PkmnTrainer205Defeat::
	.string "How could I lose?$"

CianwoodCity_Text_PkmnTrainer205Victory::
	.string "I said it, rookie trainer!$"

CianwoodCity_Text_PkmnTrainer205_2::
	.string "WAHHHHH!!! UNCLE!!!$"

CianwoodCity_Text_Trigger1::
	.string "PROF.ELM: {PLAYER}, how are things\n"
	.string "going?\p"
	.string "I sent this message because\n"
	.string "something weird is happening with\l"
	.string "the radio broadcasts.\p"
	.string "They were talking about TEAM\n"
	.string "ROCKET.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, do you know anything\n"
	.string "about it?\p"
	.string "Maybe TEAM ROCKET has returned. No,\n"
	.string "that just can’t be true.\p"
	.string "Sorry to bug you.\n"
	.string "Take care!\p"
	.string "END OF MESSAGE.$"

CianwoodCity_Text_Sign1::
	.string "CIANWOOD CITY\n"
	.string "A Port Surrounded by Rough Seas$"

CianwoodCity_Text_Sign2::
	.string "CIANWOOD CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: CHUCK\l"
	.string "His Roaring Fists Do the Talking$"

CianwoodCity_Text_Sign3::
	.string "500 Years of Tradition\n"
	.string "CIANWOOD CITY PHARMACY\l"
	.string "We Await Your Medicinal Queries$"

CianwoodCity_Text_Sign4::
	.string "CIANWOOD CITY PHOTO STUDIO\n"
	.string "Take a Snapshot as a Keepsake!$"
